---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="No path found" description="404. The planner checked, and there is genuinely no route to this page.">
  <section class="shell wrap">
    <p class="label">Error 404</p>
    <h1>No path found.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      In SkyScout this exact result was once correct. A* returned no path, I assumed the planner was
      broken, and a connected-components check showed the goal really was cut off. The empty answer was
      the right answer.
    </p>
    <p class="lede">This time it is simpler. There is no page at that address.</p>

    <pre class="term mono">planner: A*
start:   {Astro.url.pathname}
goal:    unreachable
check:   connected components -> goal not in free space
result:  no path (correct)</pre>

    <div class="btns">
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-accent">Back to the start</a>
      <a href="/missions/" class="btn">Missions</a>
      <button type="button" class="btn" data-open-console>Open the console</button>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .wrap { padding: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 6rem) 0; max-width: 680px; }

  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.4rem); margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem; }

  .lede {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .term {
    margin: 1.75rem 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
    background: var(--panel);
    border: var(--rule);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--muted);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .btns { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem; }
</style>
